---
name: Near Resistance
description: Price within 1% of daily pivot R1 and RSI overbought; candidates for resistance-rejection shorts
universe: latest_indicators
tags: [resistance, pivot, overbought, mean-reversion]
---
SELECT symbol FROM latest_indicators
WHERE close BETWEEN pivot_r1 * 0.99 AND pivot_r1 * 1.01
  AND rsi_14 > 60
ORDER BY rsi_14 DESC LIMIT 25
